+# Hammer
+
+Hammer is the maintained `hammer` Cargo package owned by the `developer-tools`
+team.
+
+From the repository root, run:
+
+```sh
+cargo run --manifest-path modules/tools/hammer/Cargo.toml
+```
+
+See the [Hammer guide](../../../docs/projects/hammer.md) before retrying a failed
+conversion; preserve the input archive first.

